## The runtime

This game stands on no engine, so the runtime under it is yours to write: the frame loop
and the delta time it measures, the canvas fit, input from both the keyboard and the
pointer, audio playback and its mute bit, loading the produced asset files, and the debug
overlay. Where this specification speaks of the runtime it means that layer, and it
states only what Arc Foundry needs from it. How the layer is structured is yours to
decide.
